===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Dondozo}}.
*'''Ocean Cyclone''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Kyogre|53}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

